# Code-only repo: ignore everything by default, then allow-list
# back in just source code, notebooks, and minimal project docs.
# No data files, images, archives, logs, or generated artifacts.

*

# Allow traversing into directories so files inside can be checked
!*/

# Source code / notebooks
!*.py
!*.ipynb
!*.js
!*.css
!*.html
!*.yaml
!*.yml

# Minimal project docs/config needed to run the code
!requirements.txt
!README.md
!PROGRESS.md
!.gitignore
